WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000022760 — Episode 28 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:03.190
I won't allow this bloodline test.

2
00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.190
My daughter has nothing to do with the dragon clan.

3
00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.690
You have no right!

4
00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.690
Lyra, I am the dragon king.

5
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.690
This is my territory. My word is law.

6
00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.190
Unless...

7
00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:17.190
you're ready to admit that Amber is our daughter.

8
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.690
Fine, your majesty.

9
00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.690
But if this test proves you wrong,

10
00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.690
will you finally leave us alone?

11
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.190
It will only prove that I'm right.

12
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.190
You're not getting away from me again.

13
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:37.430
I need a drop of Amber's blood.

14
00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.430
Don't worry. It won't hurt.

15
00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:54.910
What's going on?

16
00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:58.910
Well, um, the sacred stone hasn't been used in thousands of years.

17
00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:00.910
It may need a moment.

18
00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:02.910
How long?

19
00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:07.410
A month? A week?

20
00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:12.830
Three days, I swear.

21
00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:15.830
Absolutely no more than three days, your majesty.

22
00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:21.290
Let me go, Kael Draven.

23
00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.290
You already got Amber's blood.

24
00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:25.290
What more do you want from me?
